
### 1. API Gateway (Port 8000)

POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/process-audio
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "audio_data": ""
}



### 2. Whisper Transcription Service (Port 8001)

POST http://localhost:8001/transcribe/base64
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "audio_data": "UklGRiQAAABXQVZFZm10IBAAAAABAAEAQB8AAEAfAAABAAgAZGF0YQAAAAA="
}



### 3. Phrase Extraction Service (Port 8002)

POST http://localhost:8002/extract-phrases
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transcript": "The customer expressed terrible service and requested a refund immediately. Overall experience was unacceptable."
}



### 4. Sentiment & Emotion Analysis Service (Port 8003)

POST http://localhost:8003/analyze-sentiment
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isolated_sentence": "The customer expressed terrible service and requested a refund immediately.",
  "keyword_sentiment": "negative",
  "keyword_weight": 80.0
}

### Analyze Batch Sentiment Endpoint
POST http://localhost:8003/analyze-sentiment-batch
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {
      "isolated_sentence": "The service was absolutely terrible and I want a full refund.",
      "keyword_sentiment": "negative",
      "keyword_weight": 80.0
    },
    {
      "isolated_sentence": "Thank you so much for your quick help and support!",
      "keyword_sentiment": "positive",
      "keyword_weight": 90.0
    }
  ]
}
